ther sectors are counted, so they carry any error in the others. Non-residents are holders who live outside Taiwan. The national pension sits with the government, Chunghwa Post's savings with the banks, and mutual funds with the other financial firms. Demand deposits are deposits that can be drawn on at once, as the central bank records them. This book is money, so it is not added into the world ledger's total of owned wealth. Source: Central Bank of the Republic of China (Taiwan), Flow of Funds, used under the Open Government Data License, version 1.0; shares of the total are our calculations."}